# wasmtime 49.0.1 (46c23a87d 2026-09-24) reading of the single guest's async-lifted export.
# Regenerated by build.sh; never hand-edited. See README.md.

## Positive arms. TWO pairs, because one cannot discriminate: a guest that returned its argument
## would read 5 -> 5, and one that returned a constant would read the same value twice.
compute(5) -> 6
compute(41) -> 42

## The negative arm. Without it the arms above are consistent with a SYNC fallback path, and a
## Burroughs result matching them would say nothing about the async tier. Async is DEFAULT-ON in
## wasmtime 49, so the positive arms need no flag and this one needs an explicit disable.
compute(5) with -W component-model-async=n -> REFUSED: `task.return` requires the component model async feature (at offset 0xaef6)
